  lines:
  - Hello? Is anyone there?
  - "Dennis! Someone\u2019s on the other line! They\u2019re here!"
  - Oh thank goodness! Yes hello!
  - "I\u2019m with doctor LeBlanc, she seems to have broken her leg in a major fall."
  - It was right there. It was going to get me, so I ran and ended up in the quarry.
    I dropped my walkie at some point just east of here.
  - "Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll send people your way. What\u2019s your walkie\u2019s
    channel number? Do you know Duchamp\u2019s channel number?"
  - "Ash was the only one who knew our frequency numbers, so I don\u2019t know hers.
    But mine is set to 240."
  - She hisses in pain.
  - Careful Anna! Please hurry, before it comes for us.
